{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Play a surreal and deadly game of hide and seek through abstract realities.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Play a Surreal and Abstract game of Hide and Seek across abstract realities watching as your beloved home falls into decay as you try desperately over and over again to hunt down your target through the stages of <strong>Denial, Guilt, Depression, Resentment, and Acceptance.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore and Solve puzzles to make your way to your goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>In this thrilling remake of 'Lest they catch my hide, be EXPOSED to new levels and many BONUS features! as well as many bug fixes and level upgrades!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754860/extras/lestlite.png?t=1748684516\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>5 Chapters !</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Secret Bonus levels!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>24 Achievements!</i></strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hours of 3D Puzzles!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3754860?t=1748684516","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3754860?t=1748684516","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754860/d9e98aeb9c693d9b4793a0f4094b74f1c2e28b5f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748684516","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754860/d9e98aeb9c693d9b4793a0f4094b74f1c2e28b5f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748684516","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Includes Source SDK","id":16}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Beer bottles and needles are shown thro